  <h1>PQC Lab Baseline HTTPS Server</h1>
  <p>This endpoint represents the classical TLS baseline for the post-quantum web infrastructure experiment.</p>
  <p>The same traffic profile is executed against this server and the hybrid OQS TLS server.</p>
  <p>The objective is to compare TLS handshake latency, total request time, CPU usage, memory usage, and operational behavior through ELK observability.</p>
  <p>Baseline mode uses a classical TLS key exchange group, while the hybrid mode uses a post-quantum hybrid group.</p>
